{"id":"635095586d9d99b0","group":"58","path":"58/batch02/58-df-zfc-forcing5-properness-witness.md","title":"ZFC Forcing5 Properness Witness","display":"df-zfc-forcing5-properness-witness — ZFC Forcing5 Properness Witness","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-forcing5-properness-witness","aliases":["58-df-zfc-forcing5-properness-witness"],"display":"df-zfc-forcing5-properness-witness — ZFC Forcing5 Properness Witness","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch06/58-df-proper.md]]","[[58-df-poset]]","[[../batch10/58-df-dense.md]]","[[../batch08/58-df-compatible.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-forcing5-properness-witness"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-forcing5-properness-witness</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-forcing5-properness-witness — ZFC Forcing5 Properness Witness"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8935dcac821c0104\" href=\"?note=8935dcac821c0104\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-proper.md\">../batch06/58-df-proper.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"58-df-poset\">58-df-poset</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"681e6314e26cdd0b\" href=\"?note=681e6314e26cdd0b\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-dense.md\">../batch10/58-df-dense.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"2ad4b32e9e2eb12a\" href=\"?note=2ad4b32e9e2eb12a\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-compatible.md\">../batch08/58-df-compatible.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},p,q\\in V\">\\(M,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},p,q\\in V\\)</span> (model, forcing order, initial condition, and witness)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcing5PropernessWitness}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcing5PropernessWitness}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Poset}\">\\(\\mathrm{Poset}\\)</span> (poset predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"58-df-poset\">58-df-poset</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Dense}\">\\(\\mathrm{Dense}\\)</span> (dense-subset predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"681e6314e26cdd0b\" href=\"?note=681e6314e26cdd0b\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-dense.md\">../batch10/58-df-dense.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Compatible}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Compatible}_S\\)</span> (order-explicit compatibility predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"2ad4b32e9e2eb12a\" href=\"?note=2ad4b32e9e2eb12a\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-compatible.md\">../batch08/58-df-compatible.md</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing5\\text{-}properness\\text{-}witness} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcing5PropernessWitness}_S(M,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},p,q)\\leftrightarrow\\left(\n\\mathrm{Poset}(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\land p\\in M\\cap\\mathbb P\\land q\\in\\mathbb P\\land q\\leq_{\\mathbb P}p\\land\n\\forall D\\in M\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Dense}(D,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\to\n\\forall r\\in\\mathbb P\\;\\bigl(\nr\\leq_{\\mathbb P}q\\to\n\\exists d\\in D\\cap M\\;\\mathrm{Compatible}_S(d,r,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\n\\bigr)\n\\Bigr)\n\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing5\\text{-}properness\\text{-}witness} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcing5PropernessWitness}_S(M,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},p,q)\\leftrightarrow\\left(\n\\mathrm{Poset}(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\land p\\in M\\cap\\mathbb P\\land q\\in\\mathbb P\\land q\\leq_{\\mathbb P}p\\land\n\\forall D\\in M\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Dense}(D,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\to\n\\forall r\\in\\mathbb P\\;\\bigl(\nr\\leq_{\\mathbb P}q\\to\n\\exists d\\in D\\cap M\\;\\mathrm{Compatible}_S(d,r,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\n\\bigr)\n\\Bigr)\n\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The witness clause is the predensity-below-<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\">\\(q\\)</span> condition used by <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"8935dcac821c0104\" href=\"?note=8935dcac821c0104\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-proper.md\">../batch06/58-df-proper.md</a>, rather than a reference to an undeclared <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{MGeneric}\">\\(\\operatorname{MGeneric}\\)</span> predicate.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch06/58-df-proper.md","status":"resolved","id":"8935dcac821c0104","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-proper.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-poset","status":"resolved","id":"d3f859dbdd37f018","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-poset]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch1